From 2f3f057f597b3d934a7e4d837ed6832508fbe077 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?St=C3=A9phane=20Graber?= <stgraber@stgraber.org>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 20:09:45 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] incusd/instance/qemu: Bound the QMP log
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The log took entries of any size and was only rotated at VM start, so
a client-chosen name in a command could fill the host's log partition.
Bitmap names are also validated before reaching QMP.

This addresses GHSA-v855-hxm9-5pwg (CVE pending)

Signed-off-by: Stéphane Graber <stgraber@stgraber.org>
(cherry picked from commit 6774af1b8442bb9a25db7e46e32107ee0e7fba64)
---
 cmd/incusd/instance_bitmap.go               |  6 +++
 cmd/incusd/storage_volumes_bitmap.go        |  6 +++
 internal/server/instance/drivers/qmp/log.go | 41 +++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 53 insertions(+)

